hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2923","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar, narrated to us ‘Abdur-Rahman, narrated to us Sufyan. And also narrated to us Sallam ibn Junadah, narrated to us Waki‘, from Sufyan, from ‘Abdul-Karim, from Mujahid, from Ibn Abi Layla, from ‘Ali (RA), that the Prophet (ﷺ) ordered him to supervise the sacrificial camels (al-budn) and ordered him not to give the butcher anything from its slaughter.\n\nIn the narration of Waki‘: \not to give the butcher anything from its slaughter.\""\n\n---\n\n**CHAPTER:**"""
